l-border/articleshow/135134031.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135134031.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/shaurya-commandos-prepared-itbp-chief-flags-ongoing-china-faceoff-along-arunachal-border/articleshow/135134031.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/shaurya-commandos-prepared-itbp-chief-flags-ongoing-china-faceoff-along-arunachal-border/articleshow/135134031.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T10:18:13+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135134506,imgsize-62574.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sudan’s RSF fighters deliberately targeted atleast 43 hospitals during el-Fasher siege: Report]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sudans-rsf-fighters-deliberately-targeted-atleast-43-hospitals-during-el-fasher-siege-report/articleshow/135134067.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135134067.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[A recent BBC investigation has uncovered alarming evidence of the RSF's assault on numerous healthcare facilities in el-Fasher, Sudan. The findings reveal egregious breaches of international humanitarian law and suggest potential war crimes. The conflict has tragically resulted in healthcare workers being killed, injured, or kidnapped, significantly worsening the humanitarian crisis. UN officials have characterized the situation as possessing attributes of genocide due to persistent ethnic hostilities.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sudans-rsf-fighters-deliberately-targeted-atleast-43-hospitals-during-el-fasher-siege-report/articleshow/