c="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135132147.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-standing-to-lecture-india-new-delhi-hits-out-at-pakistan-over-minority-rights-at-un/articleshow/135132147.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-standing-to-lecture-india-new-delhi-hits-out-at-pakistan-over-minority-rights-at-un/articleshow/135132147.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T08:57:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135132698,imgsize-64054.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Congress defaming India to shield Nehru-Gandhi family: PM Modi]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-defaming-india-to-shield-nehru-gandhi-family-pm-modi/articleshow/135131324.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135131324.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[“Dimagi naxals have captured Congress so much that it has lost its ability to think. Those who used to cause destruction in forests are now determined to wreak havoc on the country through Congress,” PM Modi said, referring to hardcore Left elements accused of being sympathetic to Maoists and now vocal in protests against EC and govt.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-defaming-india-to-shield-nehru-gandhi-family-pm-modi/articleshow/135131324.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-defaming-india-to-shield-nehru-gandhi-family-pm-modi/articleshow/135131324.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T06:41:27+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135131337,imgsize-93858.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In call with Israeli counterpart, PM Modi says urgent need to restore West Asia peace]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/in-call-with-israeli-counterpart-pm-modi-says-urgent-need-to-restore-west-asia-peace/articleshow/135127541.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135127541.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[PM Modi said he had received acall from Netanyahu during which the leaders reviewed the sustained momentum in bilateral ties and reaffirmed their commitment to further strengthening the partnership. Modi did not mention Netanyahu’s invitation in his post on the conversation. “We exchanged views on developments in West Asia and underscored the urgent need to restore peace and stability in the region,” Modi said on X.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/in-call-with-israeli-counterpart-pm-modi-says-urgent-need-to-restore-west-asia-peace/articleshow/135127541.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/in-call-with-israeli-counterpart-pm-modi-says-urgent-need-to-restore-west-asia-peace/articleshow/135127541.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T02:57:41+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135127576,imgsize-89778.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Will back all meaningful efforts for Ukraine peace, PM Modi assures Poland's Tusk]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/will-back-all-meaningful-efforts-for-ukraine-peace-pm-modi-assures-polands-tusk/articleshow/135127542.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135127542.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[PM Modi and his Polish counterpart Tusk expressed deepest concern in a joint statement over the war in Ukraine, including its tragic humanitarian consequences and the impact on Global South. In his media statement, Modi assured Tusk that whether it is Ukraine or West Asia, India will continue to support every meaningful effort for peace.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/will-back-all-meaningful-efforts-for-ukraine-peace-pm-modi-assures-polands-tusk/articleshow/135127542.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/will-back-all-meaningful-efforts-for-ukraine-peace-pm-modi-assures-polands-tusk/articleshow/135127542.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T02:52:48+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135127570,imgsize-96414.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[From Jan 1, WhatsApp, Telegram won’t work without SIM cards, govt issues guidelines]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/from-jan-1-whatsapp-telegram-wont-work-without-sim-cards-govt-issues-guidelines/articleshow/135127543.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135127543.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The move is to curb cross-border cyber frauds, phishing, digital arrest scams using Indian mobile numbers and enhance telecom cyber security. Apple has updated iOS with a software patch to help detect when an iPhone is operating without a physical SIM card to abide with the rules. It is learnt Signal has not yet responded to govt notices.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/from-jan-1-whatsapp-telegram-wont-work-without-sim-cards-govt-issues-guidelines/articleshow/135127543.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/from-jan-1-whatsapp-telegram-wont-work-without-sim-cards-govt-issues-guidelines/articleshow/135127543.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T02:36:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Saurabh Sinha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135127546,imgsize-62668.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Govt plans colour-coded driving licence for Indians, foreigners]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/govt-plans-colour-coded-driving-licence-for-indians-foreigners/articleshow/135127122.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135127122.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Life insurance policies, too, would no longer be accepted as proof. Proposing sweeping changes to the driving licence (DL) regime under Motor Vehicles Rules, the road transport ministry Wednesday issued a draft notification to raise the pass mark for the online safe-driving tutorial assessment from the current 60% to 75%.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/govt-plans-colour-coded-driving-licence-for-indians-foreigners/articleshow/135127122.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/govt-plans-colour-coded-driving-licence-for-indians-foreigners/articleshow/135127122.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-23T02:32:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Dipak K Dash</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135127538,imgsize-156162.cms"/></item></channel></rss>